{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40220","headline":"陈情献中丞 · 喻坦之","name":"陈情献中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤拙竟何营，徒希折桂名。\n始终谁肯荐，得失自难明。\n贡乏雄文献，归无瘠土耕。\n沧江长发梦，紫陌久慙行。\n意纵求知切，才惟惧鉴精。\n五言非琢玉，十载看迁莺。\n取进心甘钝，伤嗟骨每惊。\n尘襟痕积泪，客鬓白新茎。\n顾盼身堪教，吹嘘羽觉生。\n依门情转切，荷德力须倾。\n奖善犹怜贡，垂恩必不轻。\n从兹便提挈，云路自生荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"喻坦之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}